                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "First of all, Castle of Illusion did not crash one time for me. \n\nI started it yesterday and just beat the evil evil..evil witch today a hour ago. \n\nYou see, my playtime was quite short..and thats the only big negative thing about the game. It is short. The final boss is really hard in comparison to all other bosses and the difficulty of the levels. \n\nThe graphics are sweet, the narrator is well done, the music is okay but pretty boring. The old Genesis /Mega Drive Music can be chosen btw. \n\nThe game is good, well done..a bit easy. But its main problem is that it is short. Glad I bought it when it was heavily reduced, and it seems thats often the case. \n\nOther people in the discussions and also in many reviews mentioned crashing as a problem, but I had luck I guess. \n\nIf you can get it for 3 or less bucks and you like Disney and jump n runs..get it.",
